<title>USA: Hannaford Bros Co April sales up 4.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Hannaford Bros Co April sales up 4.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SCARBOROUGH, Maine 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total</p>
<p>Month	     $224.3     $215.3	+4.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $984.2     $905.8	+8.7</p>
<p>    Month is	 April weeks ended	April 26.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Sales from the Easter holiday period were included in the month of March this year and in the month of April last year due to the change in timing of the holiday.</p>
